<P STYLE="text-align: right; font-size: 10pt; margin: 0"><B>Exhibit 99.1</B></P>

<P STYLE="margin: 0; font-size: 10pt">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt"><B>Mobileye Releases
Third Quarter 2026 Results, Updates Guidance, and Provides Business Overview</B></FONT></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">&nbsp;</FONT></P>

<TABLE CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" STYLE="width: 100%; font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt"><TR STYLE="font-size: 10pt; vertical-align: top">
<TD STYLE="font-size: 10pt; width: 0.25in"></TD><TD STYLE="font-size: 10pt; width: 0.25in"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Symbol; font-size: 10pt">&middot;</FONT></TD><TD STYLE="font-size: 10pt; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt; color: #101820">Revenue
                                            of </FONT><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">$492 <FONT STYLE="color: #101820">million in the
                                            </FONT>third quarter declined by 2% from Q3 2025, while <FONT STYLE="color: #101820">Operating
                                            Loss and Adjusted Operating Income in Q3 2026 improved by </FONT>25% <FONT STYLE="color: #101820">and
                                            </FONT>20%, <FONT STYLE="color: #101820">respectively, year-over-year.</FONT></FONT></TD></TR></TABLE>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">&nbsp;</FONT></P>

<TABLE CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" STYLE="width: 100%; font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt"><TR STYLE="font-size: 10pt; vertical-align: top">
<TD STYLE="font-size: 10pt; width: 0.25in"></TD><TD STYLE="font-size: 10pt; width: 0.25in"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Symbol; font-size: 10pt">&middot;</FONT></TD><TD STYLE="font-size: 10pt; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt; color: #101820">Diluted
                                            EPS (GAAP) was $(0.08) and Adjusted Diluted EPS (Non-GAAP) was $0.11 in the </FONT><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">third
                                            quarter <FONT STYLE="color: #101820">of 2026.</FONT></FONT></TD></TR></TABLE>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">&nbsp;</FONT></P>

<TABLE CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" STYLE="width: 100%; font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt"><TR STYLE="font-size: 10pt; vertical-align: top">
<TD STYLE="font-size: 10pt; width: 0.25in"></TD><TD STYLE="font-size: 10pt; width: 0.25in"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Symbol; font-size: 10pt">&middot;</FONT></TD><TD STYLE="font-size: 10pt; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt; color: #101820">Full-year
                                            2026 revenue outlook, at the midpoint, increased by </FONT><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">$13
                                            <FONT STYLE="color: #101820">million. Range narrowed to </FONT>$1,995 <FONT STYLE="color: #101820">million
                                            to </FONT>$2,020 <FONT STYLE="color: #101820">million, implying </FONT>5% <FONT STYLE="color: #101820">to
                                            </FONT>7% <FONT STYLE="color: #101820">year-over-year revenue growth.</FONT></FONT></TD></TR></TABLE>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">&nbsp;</FONT></P>

<TABLE CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" STYLE="width: 100%; font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt"><TR STYLE="font-size: 10pt; vertical-align: top">
<TD STYLE="font-size: 10pt; width: 0.25in"></TD><TD STYLE="font-size: 10pt; width: 0.25in"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Symbol; font-size: 10pt">&middot;</FONT></TD><TD STYLE="font-size: 10pt; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt; color: #101820">Full-year
                                            2026 guidance for Operating Loss (GAAP) and Adjusted Operating Income (Non-GAAP), at the
                                            midpoint, improved by </FONT><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">0.4% and 1%, respectively.</FONT></TD></TR></TABLE>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">&nbsp;</FONT></P>

<TABLE CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" STYLE="width: 100%; font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt"><TR STYLE="font-size: 10pt; vertical-align: top">
<TD STYLE="font-size: 10pt; width: 0.25in"></TD><TD STYLE="font-size: 10pt; width: 0.25in"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Symbol; font-size: 10pt">&middot;</FONT></TD><TD STYLE="font-size: 10pt; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt; color: #101820">Generated
                                            net cash from operating activities of </FONT><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">$303 <FONT STYLE="color: #101820">million
                                            in the </FONT>nine months ended September&nbsp;26, 2026<FONT STYLE="color: #101820">. Our
                                            balance sheet is strong with </FONT>$1.5 <FONT STYLE="color: #101820">billion of cash and
                                            cash equivalents, marketable securities and deposits.</FONT></FONT></TD></TR></TABLE>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">&nbsp;</FONT></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt; color: #101820">JERUSALEM
&ndash; October&nbsp;29, 2026 &ndash; Mobileye Global Inc. (Nasdaq: MBLY) (&ldquo;Mobileye&rdquo;) today released its financial results
for the three months ended </FONT><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">September&nbsp;26, 2026<FONT STYLE="color: #101820">.</FONT></FONT></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">&nbsp;</FONT></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; color: #101820"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">&ldquo;Mobileye
delivered another quarter of strong results from its ADAS products. In the first nine months of 2026, our EyeQ shipment volume was
up 11% compared to 2025. This was well ahead of global automotive production, which declined an estimated 1%,&rdquo; said Mobileye President
and CEO Prof. Amnon Shashua. &ldquo;Our multi-year growth opportunity in the consumer-owned vehicle space has two reinforcing drivers:
ADAS reaching more vehicles and Mobileye delivering more value in each vehicle. Recent Surround ADAS and Cloud-Enhanced ADAS design wins
demonstrate our expanding role beyond front-camera perception, creating a path to higher content per vehicle as these programs enter
production. In robotaxi, permits, public deployments and partner vehicle selections mark progress toward commercialization, with driver-out
performance remaining a critical milestone. Our broader participation in the value chain is intended to accelerate deployment and capture
recurring revenue opportunities alongside our capital-light self-driving system supply business.&rdquo;</FONT></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">&nbsp;</FONT></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt"></FONT></P>

<!-- Field: Page; Sequence: 1 -->
    <DIV STYLE="margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 6pt; border-bottom: Black 1pt solid"><P STYLE="margin: 0pt">&nbsp;</P></DIV>
    <DIV STYLE="break-before: page; margin-top: 6pt; margin-bottom: 12pt"><P STYLE="margin: 0pt">&nbsp;</P></DIV>
    <!-- Field: /Page -->

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt"></FONT>&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt"><B>Third Quarter 2026 Business Highlights</B></FONT></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">&nbsp;</FONT></P>

<TABLE CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" STYLE="width: 100%; font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt"><TR STYLE="font-size: 10pt; vertical-align: top">
<TD STYLE="font-size: 10pt; width: 0"></TD><TD STYLE="font-size: 10pt; width: 0.5in"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Symbol; font-size: 10pt">&middot;</FONT></TD><TD STYLE="font-size: 10pt; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">Demand for
                                            our EyeQ line of solutions has been robust throughout 2026, enabling us to meaningfully outperform
                                            initial expectations. We expect shipments to our top 10 customers to grow 7% in 2026 (including
                                            changes in safety stock inventory), even as their aggregate vehicle production is expected
                                            to decline 5%. Chinese OEMs are also choosing Mobileye to support their expansion into emerging
                                            markets, where vehicles with standard ADAS are encouraging legacy OEMs to increase ADAS fitment
                                            rates as well.</FONT></TD></TR></TABLE>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">&nbsp;</FONT></P>

<TABLE CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" STYLE="width: 100%; font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt"><TR STYLE="font-size: 10pt; vertical-align: top">
<TD STYLE="font-size: 10pt; width: 0"></TD><TD STYLE="font-size: 10pt; width: 0.5in"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Symbol; font-size: 10pt">&middot;</FONT></TD><TD STYLE="font-size: 10pt; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">Higher-value
                                            L2+ highway hands-free capability is gaining broad market adoption, with Mobility Global
                                            expecting worldwide volume in this segment to grow at an approximate 20% CAGR through the
                                            end of the decade. According to this data, Mobileye&rsquo;s EyeQ SoC is present in the majority
                                            of vehicles produced in North America and Europe in 2026 within this L2+ segment. New design wins
                                            for Surround ADAS and Cloud-Enhanced ADAS offer two routes to higher content per vehicle:
                                            supplying a broader system or adding software and road intelligence capabilities to an existing
                                            EyeQ program. We recently secured new design wins with a Top 5 global automaker from Asia
                                            and a Top 10 global automaker from Japan for Cloud-Enhanced ADAS (front-camera plus Road
                                            Experience Management (REM)) to support high-volume Level 2+ systems. These two new programs
                                            build on our Q3 announcement of Mobileye&rsquo;s nomination to supply Cloud-Enhanced ADAS
                                            for select future Stellantis vehicles in the US beginning in 2027. That project was recently
                                            expanded to include European platforms as well. As these, and other previously announced
                                            Surround ADAS and SuperVision programs, enter production, our expanded role creates a path
                                            to higher average selling prices.</FONT></TD></TR></TABLE>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">&nbsp;</FONT></P>

<TABLE CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" STYLE="width: 100%; font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt"><TR STYLE="font-size: 10pt; vertical-align: top">
<TD STYLE="font-size: 10pt; width: 0"></TD><TD STYLE="font-size: 10pt; width: 0.5in"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Symbol; font-size: 10pt">&middot;</FONT></TD><TD STYLE="font-size: 10pt; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">Progress
                                            toward commercial robotaxi deployment continued in Q3 2026 in multiple geographies and across
                                            several vehicle platforms. Our customers began autonomous ridepooling for the public in Hamburg,
                                            Germany with safety drivers, and closed-user group testing began in the greater Orlando,
                                            Florida area. The same geographically adaptable platform was also granted an autonomous driving
                                            permit that enables Holo to publicly deploy in Norway. Additionally, after multiple years
                                            of testing and validation of Mobileye-equipped vehicles, Deutsche Bahn chose HOLON Urban,
                                            enabled by Mobileye&rsquo;s self-driving system, as their autonomous vehicle of choice to
                                            serve public transit corridors in multiple German regions. As of August, based on data published
                                            by Germany&rsquo;s Federal Motor Transport Authority, we estimate that vehicles incorporating
                                            Mobileye Drive account for more than 60% of vehicles authorized for Level 4 testing in Germany.
                                            These milestones mark progress from testing toward commercial services, with driver-out performance
                                            remaining critical to scaling deployments.</FONT></TD></TR></TABLE>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">&nbsp;</FONT></P>

<TABLE CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" STYLE="width: 100%; font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt"><TR STYLE="font-size: 10pt; vertical-align: top">
<TD STYLE="font-size: 10pt; width: 0"></TD><TD STYLE="font-size: 10pt; width: 0.5in"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Symbol; font-size: 10pt">&middot;</FONT></TD><TD STYLE="font-size: 10pt; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">Alongside
                                            our capital-light self-driving system supply business, we are advancing our previously announced
                                            expansion into vertically-integrated commercial mobility as a service to accelerate validation
                                            and deployment and capture a larger share of recurring revenue as vehicles generate rider
                                            fares. We are engaging with potential vendors for vehicle platform supply, self-driving-system
                                            installation and upfit, and fleet logistics support. Mobileye invested in the Series&nbsp;B
                                            funding round for Beep,&nbsp;Inc., which closed last month, to support their accelerated
                                            commercial deployment of Autonomous Mobility Networks. Additionally, we have accelerated
                                            Moovit&rsquo;s execution of its customer-facing app, fleet optimization, and rider engagement
                                            applications. These capabilities support multiple deployment channels, including self-driving-system
                                            collaborations, our own service, and third-party demand generation platforms.</FONT></TD></TR></TABLE>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">&nbsp;</FONT></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"></P>

<!-- Field: Page; Sequence: 2 -->
    <DIV STYLE="margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 6pt; border-bottom: Black 1pt solid"><P STYLE="margin: 0pt">&nbsp;</P></DIV>
    <DIV STYLE="break-before: page; margin-top: 6pt; margin-bottom: 12pt"><P STYLE="margin: 0pt">&nbsp;</P></DIV>
    <!-- Field: /Page -->

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<TABLE CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" STYLE="width: 100%; font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt"><TR STYLE="font-size: 10pt; vertical-align: top">
<TD STYLE="font-size: 10pt; width: 0"></TD><TD STYLE="font-size: 10pt; width: 0.5in"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Symbol; font-size: 10pt">&middot;</FONT></TD><TD STYLE="font-size: 10pt; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">Mentee Robotics
                                            continues to receive external validation. Nvidia recently recognized MenteeBot as being at
                                            the forefront of embodied AI innovation, developing learning-capable humanoid robots that
                                            continuously adapt and improve in real-world environments. Mentee&rsquo;s use of NVIDIA&rsquo;s
                                            Isaac simulation and AI computing platforms accelerates the development of advanced physical
                                            AI capabilities and reinforces the value of our technology and IP.</FONT></TD></TR></TABLE>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">&nbsp;</FONT></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt"><B>Third Quarter 2026 Financial Summary
