<TD STYLE="font-size: 10pt; width: 0"></TD><TD STYLE="font-size: 10pt; width: 0.5in"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Symbol; font-size: 10pt">&middot;</FONT></TD><TD STYLE="font-size: 10pt; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">The
                                            R&amp;D Law benefit is expected to extend into future years, subject to future changes in
                                            the law. Quarterly recognition may vary depending on recognition thresholds, qualifying R&amp;D
